meta {
  name: 17 Deliver stop (OTP or photo)
  type: http
  seq: 17
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/delivery-partner/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/deliver/
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  X-App-Platform: DeliveryApp
  Authorization: Bearer {{deviceKey}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "stop_id": "{{stopId}}",
    "type": "otp",
    "otp_code": "123456",
    "latitude": {{lat}},
    "longitude": {{lng}},
    "accuracy_m": 25
  }
}

docs {
  Happy-path stop close. Round-two contract:
  - `type` is REQUIRED and must be "otp" or "photo". Absent/unknown → 400
    (VALIDATION_ERROR / INVALID_TYPE). See round2/ for those cases.
  - `stop_id` is REQUIRED and must belong to THIS assignment (else 400 STOP_MISMATCH).
  - For "photo": upload via request 21 first, set "photo_captured": true and omit otp_code.
  - `accuracy_m` (optional) is the GPS fix error; the server widens the geofence by it
    (capped +150m) so a poor urban fix doesn't lock you out at the door.
  - A correct code that then fails the geofence is NOT consumed — move closer and retry.
  - COD is withdrawn: do not send cod_collected / cod_amount (the app no longer does).
  - Idempotent: replaying a completed delivery returns 200 {already_delivered:true}.
}
